        "TileImage": "$($repository 45abfef9-3458-4da8-8614-965330559aa3).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings everyone. Polish bro here.\r\rBerlin&apos;s final dance left the underground in chaos, but the bodies uncovered only part of the truth. Before the lights went out at the club, one name surfaced in ICA&apos;s intelligence: Haven Island. Several people connected to the Berlin gathering have retreated to this tropical paradise, hoping to bury the evidence and disappear.\r\rThey thought Berlin was the end of the story.\r\rThey were wrong. The Quest of the Damned continues - and paradise won&apos;t save them.\r\rCreator - Polishbro456",
